<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In V Future Research Directions ‣ Enabling Regulatory Multi-Agent Collaboration: Architecture, Challenges, and Solutions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Incentive-Aligned Agent Regulation</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Enabling Regulatory Multi-Agent Collaboration: Architecture, Challenges, and Solutions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VI </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Conclusion</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Enabling Regulatory Multi-Agent Collaboration: Architecture, Challenges, and Solutions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
